notes.content:
[list]
[*]Added video filters (linear, bilinear, CRT, etc);
[*]Added screen shake force setting;
[*]Greatly reduced input lag when using VSync in DirectX mode;
[*]Fixed several minor visual issues with the scrolling and parallax effects of the backgrounds.
[/list]

[list]
[*]Added info text in options screen indicating which graphics API is being used;
[*]Fixed a bug where the player could take damage from Boss Papa Chicken harpoons even after defeating him;
[*]Fixed a bug where the player could take damage from big cannon's body in level 07-02 even after defeating him.
[/list]

[list]
[*]Changed main graphics API to OpenGLCore on Windows build to reduce input lag when V-Sync is enabled;
[*]Fixed a bug in floating platforms on stage 04-01 where sometimes the platform sank and didn't come back to surface;
[*]Adjusted volume for the player's SFXs;
[*]Added missing SFXs on the final boss battle.
[/list]

[list]
[*]Fixed death animation when dying on hanging bars;
[*]Extra life now spawns only once per level, except when the game is restarted via the pause menu;
[*]Fixed a bug where the player could take damage from Boss Skull Guardian even after defeating him;
[*]Stage/Level notification will now only be displayed at the first level of each stage, boss fights, stage 2 checkpoints, and when the game is restarted from the pause menu.
[/list]
